<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA 319-6 AT CLOSE V AUSTRALIA (182).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 319-6 AT CLOSE V AUSTRALIA (182).</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 319 for six at the close on the second day of the one-off test on Friday in reply to Australia's first innings total of 182.</p>
</text>
